#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice/guides/low-overhead-error-detection-using-spacetime-codes/extracted-outputs/f6777fe6-6612-47c9-babe-6e6ea9c19ee4-0.avif)\n"
